# students.csv — roster for scripts/10-users.sh   (KEEP PRIVATE: chmod 600)
#
# One row per student:   username,password,full name
#   username : YYfirst.last  (YY = 2-digit graduation year), lowercase, no spaces
#   password : leave BLANK to auto-generate one (written to the credentials file)
#   full name: optional; stored as the account comment. No commas in any field.
#
# Copy this to the path in config.env (STUDENT_ROSTER_CSV, default /opt/cst-vm/students.csv),
# edit, then:  sudo bash provision.sh 10   (or add --dry-run to preview).
